<h2>Florida Real Estate Licensing FAQ</h2>
</div>
<div class="faq-list">
<details><summary>What is included in the $280 licensing course option?</summary><p>The package includes the DBPR-approved Florida Sales Associate pre-licensing Course 1, course certification, exam-prep materials, audio/video instruction, 500+ Q&amp;A, study supplements, one year of access, and direct support from Daniel.</p></details>
<details><summary>What does FastPass add?</summary><p>FastPass adds three Florida licensing-exam-style exams and a structured preparation path designed to build exam timing, speed, confidence, and familiarity with the testing experience.</p></details>
<details><summary>Does FastPass replace the Florida state licensing exam?</summary><p>No. The Florida state licensing exam is a separate exam administered by <a href="https://www.pearsonvue.com/us/en/fl/dbpr.html" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Pearson Professional Assessments</a> (formerly Pearson VUE). FastPass is preparation and part of the course-certification path; you still take the state exam separately.</p></details>
<details><summary>How long do I have access?</summary><p>Course bundles include one year of online access.</p></details>
<details><summary>Can I contact the owner directly?</summary><p>Yes. You can text the owner directly at <a href="sms:+12394718500">239.471.8500</a> or email <a href="mailto:daniel@daniellarsontraining.com">daniel@daniellarsontraining.com</a> about the course, exam preparation, or your licensing steps.</p></details>
<details><summary>Do I need printed course books?</summary><p>No. All course content is included online. If you prefer printed books, just request them and Daniel will ship them to you free.</p></details>
